# BATCH_1_LINKED_REORDER — context receipt and safe reorganization

Purpose: improve docs-to-feature-to-source navigation without breaking imports.
Working directory: `/home/pro/Downloads/expiry`; inspected branch: develop.

Source-of-truth read: root maps, current docs feature/FR/UC/navigation catalog,
system definition/scope and current App/Detail/Shell/contracts/migrations.
Intentionally not read as current authority: every consolidated historical source,
remote native document revision, binary Workbench model and production database.
Searches: tracked file inventory, Markdown link targets, namespace IDs, runtime imports.
Codegraph: `.tmb/evidence/source-inventory.json` (static imports only).

Allowed: `.tmb`, local root maps, exact ignored LAYOUT/ROADMAP aliases, breadcrumb
presentation/callers/CSS. Forbidden: source-folder moves, schema writes, deployment,
hackathon/global skill mutation and unrelated cleanup. Stop if alias exists with
different target or a proposed source-path correction is ambiguous.

## Classification and conflicts

- Current source/DDL/contracts: CANONICAL_CURRENT implementation definitions,
  not evidence of live schema or all contract outputs.
- Food FR/UC/features/navigation docs: CANONICAL_CURRENT design references with
  their own Review labels, not automatically product approved.
- Scope contains Approved claims while earlier catalog/crosswalk contain Review
  or proposal boundaries: UNKNOWN_REVIEW_REQUIRED for cross-document approval.
  Preserve labels; no generated file upgrades the source approval.
- Consolidated snapshots: HISTORICAL_OK provenance, never overwrite with current code.
- Process skill text copies: TEMPLATE_OR_EXAMPLE; actual installed skill source wins.
- `.tmb` and local aliases: GENERATED_NOT_SOT/local derived navigation.
- Stale old-folder links: DANGEROUS_CURRENT_REFERENCE when an active design doc
  points to a nonexistent authority. Full diagnostic list is in docs-link-audit.json.
  DOC-01 is a separate reference hotfix specification; physical moves are paused
  until exact source/target references can be approved and repaired together.

## Actions and exact preservation

Files moved/archived: none. Original numbered docs/source ownership remains stable.
Created: docs/app layout, ordered diagrams, feature task specs/status views,
offline retrieval, catalog, relative local aliases and scoped ignore entries.
Edited: local root navigation/status/skill receipts; presentation-only breadcrumb
owners listed in `.tmb/evidence/scope.json`.

## Verification

Run `python3 .tmb/tools/knowledge.py catalog`, `index`, `check` and
`python3 .tmb/tools/context.py refresh`, `audit`.
Results are recorded in `.tmb/VERIFICATION.md` and machine evidence.
Local alias/index batch can pass while source-link hotfix remains open;
do not report the entire documentation vault as clean. The classification has
not semantically reviewed every source document. Generated catalog exposes
metadata and exact link failures for follow-up review, not guessed authority.

Recommended next batch: DOC-01 source-link repair, 5–10 reviewed source files
per batch, historical links preserved and structural validation rerun.
