<!-- trustmebro -->
# API layout, route index and business owners

Updated: 2026-10-11. [A] Implemented source; DB/browser acceptance is separate.
Root: `apps/api/src/server.mjs:bootstrap` loads env, creates app/listens, shuts down
HTTP and pools. Composition: `apps/api/src/app.mjs:createApp` injects dependencies.
Status view: `.tmb/layouts/api/ROADMAP.md`; root task truth: `ROADMAP.md`.

## Middleware order and ownership

`CORS/body parser → /health OR /api/v1 → /auth router → requireAuth → requireCsrf
→ scan router → idempotencyMiddleware → inventory/expiry routers → 404/errorHandler`.

Auth register/login validate origin before credentials. Session/logout verify stored
cookie token; logout requires CSRF. Inventory/preferences commands require owner
session+trusted origin+CSRF+idempotency key. Scan is transient, placed before the
idempotency middleware; it still requires session and CSRF on POST.

## Source owners

| Source | Responsibility | Dependency direction |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `apps/api/src/modules/auth/auth.routes.mjs` | createAuthBoundary, cookie/origin/CSRF/session TTL, bounded rate buckets | route → AuthRepository/crypto; establishes req.userId |
| `apps/api/src/modules/auth/auth.crypto.mjs` | scrypt verifier, hash/token/HMAC/timing-safe checks | pure credential functions; no DB/UI |
| `apps/api/src/modules/auth/auth.repository.mjs` | credential/session SQL transactions, rotation/revocation/current | connection pool; users/local_credentials/user_sessions |
| `apps/api/src/modules/inventory/inventory.routes.mjs` | router registration | controller only |
| `apps/api/src/modules/inventory/inventory.controller.mjs` | strict query parsing; HTTP status/Location/replay headers | InventoryService |
| `apps/api/src/modules/inventory/inventory.service.mjs` | query/DTO composition, history page slice, command forwarding | PublicInventoryRepository + readPreferences |
| `apps/api/src/modules/inventory/public-inventory.repository.mjs` | publicCommandWork wraps command result before cached replay save | extends shared InventoryRepository; shares same transaction |
| `apps/api/src/modules/expiry/expiry.routes.mjs` | preferences routes | ExpiryController |
| `apps/api/src/modules/expiry/expiry.controller.mjs` | response/replay/error forwarding | ExpiryService |
| `apps/api/src/modules/expiry/expiry.service.mjs` | only public prefs fields; owner existence; versioned prefs writes | InventoryRepository + connection |
| `apps/api/src/modules/scan/scan.routes.mjs` | canonical scans plus legacy scan/health adapter routes | ScanController |
| `apps/api/src/modules/scan/scan.controller.mjs` | upload field image/file, response forwarding | upload parser + ScanService |
| `apps/api/src/modules/scan/scan.upload.mjs` | bounded stream/base64, media signatures, declared type consistency | no persistence; Python handles full codec decoding |
| `apps/api/src/modules/scan/scan.service.mjs` | internal fetch deadline, sanitized error projection, publicScanResult | Python /scan and /health; no SQL |
| `apps/api/src/shared/domain.mjs` | uuid/milli/decimal/date/metadata/reason/allow/expected/preferences/attention/fingerprint | reusable authoritative pure rules |
| `apps/api/src/shared/repository.mjs` | InventoryRepository, transaction+ledger+row lock+version+replay | injected clock/hooks, connection; MySQL |
| `apps/api/src/shared/public-dto.mjs` | Entry/Movement/Preferences projection, UTC instants, publicAttention/pagination | domain functions |
| `apps/api/src/shared/middleware.mjs` | idempotency requirement and sanitized problem output | DomainError |
| `apps/api/src/shared/connection.mjs` | env lookup, bounded MySQL pools, UTC connection lifecycle | mysql2; does not run migrations |

## Every Node HTTP operation

Base for domain routes: `/api/v1`. Paths below include full base.

| Method/path | Handler / source symbol | Input → result / storage |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| GET /health | createApp inline handler | source service health metadata; not DB/OCR readiness |
| POST /api/v1/auth/register | createAuthBoundary register | email/password/name/timezone → session cookie+AuthSession; account/session transaction |
| POST /api/v1/auth/login | createAuthBoundary login | verifier check → rotated durable session |
| GET /api/v1/auth/session | createAuthBoundary authenticate | cookie hash lookup → principal/CSRF/expiry |
| POST /api/v1/auth/logout | createAuthBoundary logout | cookie+origin+CSRF → revoke/clear cookie;204 |
| POST /api/v1/food-entries | InventoryController.create → createEntry → repo.create | metadata/quantity string/unit →201 Entry+Location; initial event |
| GET /api/v1/food-entries | InventoryController.list → listEntries → repo.list | view/lifecycle/attention/q/location/page/limit → EntryList |
| GET /api/v1/food-entries/:id | InventoryController.get → getEntry → repo.get | owner UUID/entry UUID → current Entry projection |
| PATCH /api/v1/food-entries/:id | InventoryController.edit → editEntry → repo.edit | metadata+expected_version →200 Entry |
| DELETE /api/v1/food-entries/:id | InventoryController.remove → removeEntry → repo.remove | expected_version query → soft-delete204 |
| POST /api/v1/food-entries/:id/movements | recordMovement → repo.consume/mutate movement | kind consume/discard + amount/reason/version →201 MutationResult |
| GET /api/v1/food-entries/:id/movements | listMovements → repo.get history | page/limit → MovementList; loads all history then slices |
| POST /api/v1/food-entries/:id/recounts | recount → recountQuantity → repo.recount | actual_quantity/reason/version →201 changed or200 no-op |
| POST /api/v1/food-entries/:id/restore | restore → restoreEntry → repo.restore | version →200 restored Entry |
| GET /api/v1/trash/food-entries | listTrash → repo.list view trash/lifecycle all | EntryList including depleted deleted items |
| GET /api/v1/me/preferences | ExpiryController.getPreferences → service | timezone/lead/version only |
| PATCH /api/v1/me/preferences | updatePreferences → repo.setPreferences | partial prefs/version → public prefs; owner-row lock |
| POST /api/v1/scans | ScanController.upload | multipart image or base64 → candidate object; no domain write |
| POST /api/v1/scan | ScanController.scan | legacy multipart file/base64 path → same candidate result |
| GET /api/v1/scan/health | ScanController.health | Python capability status projection |

13 core operations +4 auth operations are in `contracts/public-api.yaml`.
Node /health, legacy /scan and /scan/health are extra runtime routes.
Auto-captured route registrations: `.tmb/evidence/source-inventory.json`.

## Command lifecycle/invariants

`principal → normalized request fingerprint → INSERT owner/key reservation
→ replay original result if identical → lock owner entry → compare version
→ domain write + append stock movement → public DTO → save response → COMMIT`.
Failures rollback key and writes. Replay is resolved before version comparison.
Deadlocks retry same command at most3 times after the initial attempt.
Metadata/visibility changes do not rewrite quantity history. Recount no-op makes
no new movement/version; initial create inserts exactly one initial event.

## Feature extension points and verification

Add business behavior in domain/service/repository; keep routing/controller as
adapters. Schema work belongs to versioned migrations. Read-only projections can
reuse existing selectors/DTOs. New command must retain owner/key/hash/lock/version/
transaction/replay behavior and public mapping before cache save.
API tests: `apps/api/tests/api.test.mjs`, `apps/api/tests/auth.test.mjs`,
`apps/api/tests/public-contract.test.mjs`; real DB opt-in:
`apps/api/tests/auth.mysql.test.mjs`. Exact current result: `.tmb/VERIFICATION.md`.
