# Entry, local environment, delivery and verification map

Updated: 2026-10-11. [A] Config source, not a deployment performed in this task.
Status view: `.tmb/layouts/delivery/ROADMAP.md`.

| Source | Role / configuration | Dependency / boundary |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `package.json` | npm workspaces apps/*; build:web/test:api/test:python/test:all/dev scripts | root CLI entry |
| `apps/web/package.json` | React19, Vite8, TypeScript, Tailwind4, formatter; no test script | web package |
| `apps/web/vite.config.ts` | React/Tailwind/Figma plugins, alias, host, port8443, /api dev proxy→3001 | dev proxy only; preview has no same proxy block |
| `apps/web/site.config.ts` | metadata/language/assets configuration | Vite HTML plugin |
| `apps/web/tsconfig.json` | compiler project | tsc check includes inactive TS files too |
| `vercel.json` | root build/output/rewrites | web build routing |
| `apps/web/vercel.json` | package-local build/output/rewrites | selected deploy root matters |
| `apps/api/package.json` | Express/mysql2/cors runtime, node test/watch/start | Node API package |
| `apps/api/Dockerfile` | API image build/start | root Compose |
| `apps/api/src/server.mjs` | env/bootstrap/listen/shutdown | pool cleanup |
| `apps/api/src/shared/connection.mjs` | reads cwd/api/sandbox env, process env priority, pool | runtime credentials remain private |
| `apps/api/src/app.mjs` | APP_ORIGIN/CORS/secureCookie policy and route composition | session transport must match frontend origin |
| `compose.yaml` | mysql/python-scan/api containers, loopback ports3307/8000/3001 | full-stack topology; separate root mysql_data volume |
| `database/mysql/compose.yaml` | existing sandbox project/volume/port | not interchangeable with root Compose |
| `services/python-scan/Dockerfile` | Python3.12 plus eng/vie OCR binaries | requirements install; service port8000 |
| `docs/deploy/github.md` | tracked GitHub delivery notes | reference process, not acceptance |

## Startup/data topology

Local dev: Vite browser → /api proxy → Node3001 → pooled MySQL3307;
Node scan adapter → Python8000. Current browser entry still invokes mockApi,
so proxy existence alone does not establish this data flow.
Container topology: API connects to mysql internal3306 and python-scan8000.
Compose maps full migrations directory into MySQL entrypoint for fresh-volume
initialization; standalone runner handles version/checksum differently.

No worker/job/scheduler implementation was found in the mapped runtime source.
Attention is computed on read, not by a background notification job.

## Source-observed handoff gaps [D]

- F-06: review root fresh-init migration ledger/grants versus standalone runner;
  explicit upgrade/checksum/partial-DDL lifecycle needs one deliberate delivery owner.
- F-06: Compose NODE_ENV=production and origin/cookie config must be tested against
  the intended browser origin; secure host-cookie policy is not proven by localhost health.
- F-01: production/preview API routing must accompany live App integration.
- F-00: local typing/build now pass after responsive prerequisite repair; the
  existing build command still does not itself enforce the TypeScript gate.
- Python host unit environment lacks pydantic; container Dockerfile dependencies
  are declarations, not evidence that the host interpreter has them installed.

## Commands and effect boundaries

| Command | Owner / effect | Result in this mapping task |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| npm run test:api | injected HTTP/auth/DTO tests; MySQL integration skip by default |19PASS/0FAIL/1SKIP |
| pnpm exec tsc --noEmit (apps/web) | compiler; no source emission |PASS in RSP check;3initial errors resolved |
| npm run build:web | ignored apps/web/dist output |PASS |
| npm run test:python | host unittest |blocked by pydantic import |
| EXPIRY_AUTH_MYSQL_TEST=1 npm run test:api | creates isolated DB +auth migrations |not run here |
| node database/mysql/tests/run.mjs | fresh DB creation/concurrency/restore |not run here |
| docker compose up | services/volumes/data changes |not run here |

`.tmb/VERIFICATION.md` owns dated results; map source alone never establishes
browser/device/network/database/deployment acceptance.
