| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| UI navigation/modals/drafts | `apps/web/src/App.tsx` | Shell/features/mockApi |
| HTTP composition | `apps/api/src/app.mjs` | auth → scan → idempotency → inventory/expiry |
| Quantity/date rules | `apps/api/src/shared/domain.mjs` | decimal milliunits, clock |
| Commands/replay | `apps/api/src/shared/repository.mjs` | MySQL; DTO before replay save |
