 S->>DB: Begin, reserve key / check replay
 alt Key already completed, same fingerprint
  DB-->>S: Saved response
 else New command
  S->>S: Validate domain metadata and quantity
  S->>DB: Insert entry + initial movement + response
  S->>DB: Commit
 end
 S-->>API: EntryResponse
